对标准高斯先验，KL项解析可得：
\begin{equation}
  \label{eq:pgm-generative-diagonal-kl}
  \operatorname{KL}(q_{\bm{\phi}}\,\|\,p)
  =\frac{1}{2}\sum_{j=1}^{k}
     \bigl(m_{\bm{\phi},j}^2+s_{\bm{\phi},j}^2
            -1-\log s_{\bm{\phi},j}^2\bigr).
\end{equation}

