因此，给定原观测的任意一步分布为
\begin{equation}
  \label{eq:pgm-generative-forward-marginal}
  \begin{aligned}
    q(\bm{x}_t\mid\bm{x}_0)
      &=\mathcal{N}(\bm{x}_t;
